    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'deploy on longitude'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The geographic longitude of the location where the animal was released. Intended primarily for cases in which the animal release location has higher accuracy than that derived from sensor data. Example: \'-97.3321\'; Units: decimal degrees, WGS84 reference system; Entity described: deployment'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000079'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000098/3/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000098/3/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000098/>;
    dc:modified '2021-04-07T19:41:01'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'eobs status'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The record status, from e-obs GPS/accelerometer tags (definition from e-obs Digital Telemetry Manual for DataDecoder Software, 2010). Allowed values are A = position and time within accuracy masks; B = only time of week and weeknumber valid; C = only weeknumber valid; D = no valid data. Format: controlled list; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000098'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000100/3/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000100/3/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000100/>;
    dc:modified '2021-04-07T19:41:01'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'eobs type of fix'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The type of fix of data from e-obs GPS/accelerometer tags (definition from e-obs Digital Telemetry Manual for DataDecoder Software, 2010). Allowed values are 3 = 3D fix and 2 = 2D fix. Format: controlled list; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000100'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000116/3/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000116/3/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000116/>;
    dc:modified '2021-04-07T19:41:01'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'GPS fix type'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The type of GPS fix. To import non-numeric characters use \'GPS fix type raw\'. Allowed values are 1 = no fix; 2 = 2D fix (altitude typically not valid); 3 = 3D fix (altitude typically valid). Format: controlled list; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000116'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000117/3/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000117/3/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000117/>;
    dc:modified '2021-04-07T19:41:01'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'GPS fix type raw'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The type of GPS fix as provided by the tag. Common values are 1D = no fix; 2D = altitude typically not valid; 3D = altitude typically valid. Other values might be present. Where possible, use \'GPS fix type\'. Example: \'3D\'; Units: none; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000117'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000138/3/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000138/3/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000138/>;
    dc:modified '2021-04-07T19:41:01'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'license terms'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Terms of use for the data in the study, provided by the study owner. Also see \'license type\' for use of Creative Commons licenses. In addition to terms listed, the General Movebank Terms of Use and User Agreement apply for all studies. Example: \'Data can be viewed publicly and used for educational purposes, but cannot be shared or used in publications without prior written permission from principal investigator.\'; Units: none; Entity described: study'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000138'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000161/3/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000161/3/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000161/>;
    dc:modified '2021-04-07T19:41:01'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'migration stage standard'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Migration state of the animal. Values are chosen from a controlled list: altitudinal migration; breeding grounds; fall migration; foraging grounds; foraging migration; irruptive migration; latitudinal migration; migration to molt site; molt site; natal area; nomadic migration; other seasonal migration; removal migration; reproductive migration; spawning grounds; spring migration; stopover; summer non-breeding; vertical migration (aquatic); wintering grounds. Format: controlled list; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000161'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000192/3/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000192/3/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000192/>;
    dc:modified '2021-04-07T19:41:01'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'TechnoSmart activity'@en ;
    skos:definition 'An indication of whether an animal is active. Possible values are \'active\' and \'inactive\'. The threshold used to define activity is dependent on how the tag is configured by the user. Format: controlled list; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000192'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000204/3/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000204/3/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000204/>;
    dc:modified '2021-04-07T19:41:01'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'update ts'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Used in the REST API. The date and time that the event was last updated in the Movebank database. If the event has not been modified this will indicate when the event was created, i.e. imported to the study in Movebank. Records created before this attribute was added to the database will have the value \'1970-01-01 00:00:00.000\'. Example: \'1970-01-01 00:00:00.000\'; Format: yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss.SSS; Units: UTC; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000204'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000207/3/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000207/3/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000207/>;
    dc:modified '2021-04-07T19:41:01'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'UTM zone'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The UTM zone used to convert locations from decimal degrees to UTM. Selected based on the location of each event. Format: controlled list; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000207'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000238/2/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000238/2/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000238/>;
    dc:modified '2021-04-07T19:41:01'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'suspend license terms'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Used in the REST API. Whether or not the study owner allows users that are not Data Managers to download data without accepting license terms. This is sometimes done to facilitate access through external applications. Units: none; Entity described: study'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000238'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000072/3/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000072/3/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000072/>;
    dc:modified '2021-04-07T19:41:01'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'contact person name'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'contact person'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The name and username of the Movebank account for the person who is the contact for the study. Example: \'Rolandisimo (Roland Kays)\'; Units: none; Entity described: study'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000072'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000164/3/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000164/3/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000164/>;
    dc:modified '2021-04-07T19:41:01'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'principal investigator name'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'principal investigator'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The principal investigator (PI) or lead researcher for the study. Reported either as the PI name or the name and username of the associated Movebank account. Example: \'Rolandisimo (Roland Kays)\'; Units: none; Entity described: study'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000164'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000245/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000245/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000245/>;
    dc:modified '2021-04-07T19:41:00'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'angular velocities raw'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Burst of angular velocity values along the X, Y, and/or Z axes of the tag, depending on which axes are enabled. Measurements alternate one measurement for each active axis in alphabetical order. Example: \'19.5625 -53.0625 7.1250 71.3125 -130.3125 15.9375 123.4375 -140.7500 8.6250\'; Units: not defined; Entity described: event'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:MVB::MVB000245'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000246/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000246/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/MVB/current/MVB000246/>;
